{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0150000000000000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 2940,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n# OLS linear regression\nIdentify the population target, define the sample fitting rule, then add the assumptions needed for statistical guarantees. A curved predictor feature can remain linear in its coefficients. Cyan marks objects and interpretation, purple sample fitting algebra, and yellow statistical assumptions and guarantees; use [[知识原子.base|the knowledge index]] for navigation.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n# OLS 线性回归\n先界定总体目标，再定义样本拟合规则，最后补充统计结论所需的假设。原变量上的曲线也可以对系数线性。青色表示对象与解释，紫色表示样本拟合代数，黄色表示统计假设与保证；[[知识原子.base|知识索引]]用于导航。"
    },
    {
      "id": "0150000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[条件均值与线性投影|Conditional mean or linear projection]]\nA conditional mean averages the outcome at given information. A best linear predictor minimizes expected squared error within chosen features; it need not reproduce the complete mean.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[条件均值与线性投影]]\n条件均值是在给定信息下平均结果；最佳线性预测在选定特征中最小化期望平方误差，不必等于完整均值。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0150000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[参数线性|Linearity in coefficients]]\nKnown features may be squared, logged or interacted. Their unknown weights must enter additively and linearly. Estimating the feature shape or changing the parameter domain requires a separate check.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[参数线性]]\n已知特征可以平方、取对数或交互，未知权重以线性可加方式进入。若还估计特征形状或改变参数域，需要另行检查。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "015000000000000e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[level-log 系数解释|level 与 log]]\n*Levels, logs, and coefficient units*\n\n谁取对数决定单位变化、半弹性或弹性的读法；因变量取 log 时，回到原尺度还要处理重转换。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "015000000000000f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[取值依赖边际效应|取值依赖的边际效应]]\n*Value-dependent marginal effects*\n\n二次项和连续交互项用导数读边际效应；涉及离散变量时应比较有限差分。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0150000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[普通最小二乘|Ordinary least squares]]\nChoose unrestricted coefficients minimizing the equally weighted sum of squared observed-minus-fitted gaps. The observed fitted vector is unique; coefficient uniqueness is a separate rank question.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[普通最小二乘]]\n在无约束系数中，选择使等权重的观测减拟合平方和最小的解。原设计上的拟合向量唯一；系数唯一性另看秩。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "0150000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[回归残差|Regression residuals]]\n$\\hat u=y-X\\hat\\beta$ is observed minus fitted. It uses estimated coefficients and need not equal the unobserved model error $u$. Its definition does not require a correct probability model.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[回归残差]]\n$\\hat u=y-X\\hat\\beta$ 是观测减拟合；它使用估计系数，不必等于未观察的模型误差 $u$。残差定义本身不要求概率模型正确。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "0150000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[满列秩与OLS唯一性|Unique OLS coefficients]]\nFor unrestricted finite-real OLS, full column rank is equivalent to a unique coefficient vector. Rank deficiency leaves infinitely many representations of the same unique observed fitted vector.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[满列秩与OLS唯一性]]\n对无约束、有限实数数据的 OLS，满列秩等价于系数向量唯一。秩亏留下无穷多种系数表示，但原设计上的拟合向量仍唯一。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "0150000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[OLS正规方程|Normal equations]]\n$X'\\hat u=0$ characterizes unrestricted OLS minima, including rank-deficient designs. An intercept makes residuals sum to zero. These are properties of the actual fitted rows and columns.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[OLS正规方程]]\n$X'\\hat u=0$ 刻画无约束 OLS 最小值，秩亏时也成立。含截距则残差和为零。这些性质针对实际拟合的行与列。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "0150000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 1030,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[一元 OLS 斜率|Simple-regression slope]]\nWith an intercept and positive sample variation in $x$, the slope is $S_{xy}/S_{xx}$. Use matching covariance/variance divisors. Without an intercept or with constant $x$, reconsider the formula.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[一元 OLS 斜率]]\n含截距且 $x$ 有样本变动时，斜率为 $S_{xy}/S_{xx}$；协方差和方差要用同一分母。无截距或 $x$ 恒定时须重新判断公式。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "0150000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[FWL残差化定理|FWL residualization]]\nWith a full-column-rank design, remove the same controls from outcome and focal column on the same rows. Regress the residual vectors through the origin to recover the full model’s focal coefficient and residuals. Match the full model’s degrees of freedom and covariance rule for standard errors.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[FWL残差化定理]]\n完整设计满列秩时，在相同行上从结果和焦点列扣除同一控制项，再将残差向量不另加截距地回归，恢复完整模型的焦点系数与残差。标准误须匹配完整模型的自由度与协方差规则。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "0150000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 1030,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多元回归系数|Multiple-regression coefficients]]\nA coefficient changes a fitted value when its column changes and other included columns stay fixed. A raw-variable change may move several transformed columns. Population-mean and causal interpretations require additional justification.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[多元回归系数]]\n某列变化、其他已含列固定时，系数描述拟合值变化。原始变量变化可能同时移动多列变换项；总体均值与因果解释仍需另行论证。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0150000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[样本正交与总体外生性|Sample orthogonality and exogeneity]]\nOLS forces $X'\\hat u=0$. It does not verify the population condition $E(u\\mid X)=0$ for the target model. A coefficient can absorb systematic error while residual orthogonality holds.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[样本正交与总体外生性]]\nOLS 强制 $X'\\hat u=0$，却不验证目标模型的总体条件 $E(u\\mid X)=0$。系数吸收系统误差时，残差正交仍会成立。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "015000000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "## [[零条件均值无偏性|零条件均值与条件无偏]]\n*Zero conditional mean and conditional unbiasedness*\n\n给定完整设计矩阵时，$E(u\\mid X)=0$ 使有限样本 OLS 满足 $E(\\hat\\beta\\mid X)=\\beta$。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "015000000000000b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1750,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[OLS一致性条件|OLS consistency]]\nFor a fixed number of regressors, the standard argument needs the normalized Gram matrix XᵀX/n to have a nonsingular limit and the regressor–error average Xᵀu/n to vanish. Finite-sample unbiasedness alone does not provide these limits. Nonshrinking variance alone does not disprove probability convergence.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[OLS一致性条件|OLS一致性]]\n解释变量个数固定时，常用论证需要归一化 Gram 矩阵 XᵀX/n 趋于非奇异极限、乘积平均 Xᵀu/n 趋零。有限样本无偏不提供这些极限；方差不收缩也不能单独推断不一致。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "015000000000000c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2300,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[经典 Gauss–Markov 定理|Classical Gauss–Markov]]\nWith fixed full-column-rank design, zero-mean errors and covariance σ²I, OLS has minimum covariance among linear unbiased rules. Normality is not required.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[经典 Gauss–Markov 定理]]\n固定满列秩设计、误差均值零且协方差σ²I时，OLS在线性无偏规则中协方差最小；不要求正态性。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "015000000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2300,
      "y": 1030,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[BLUE正态性边界|Normality and OLS inference]]\nBLUE compares variances within a class; it does not imply a normal sampling law. With full column rank, n > k and conditional errors N(0, σ²I) with σ² > 0, the classical residual variance estimate gives exact t/F inference.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[BLUE正态性边界|正态性与 OLS 推断]]\nBLUE 比较指定类内的方差，不确定抽样分布形状。满列秩、n > k、给定 X 的误差服从 N(0, σ²I) 且 σ² > 0 时，经典残差方差估计支持精确 t/F 推断。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "0150000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 2940,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "## [[回归推断.canvas|进入：回归推断]]\n*Continue to regression inference*\n\n系数如何算、何时无偏或 BLUE 只是估计层；标准误、t/F/Wald、p 值、区间和选择后有效性进入独立子地图。",
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
