      "label": "Minimization forces included-column orthogonality · 最小化强制已含列正交"
    },
    {
      "id": "e150000000000007",
      "fromNode": "0150000000000005",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "0150000000000007",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "Intercept and nonconstant predictor give the ratio · 截距和非恒定变量给出比值"
    },
    {
      "id": "e150000000000008",
      "fromNode": "0150000000000005",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "0150000000000009",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Eliminate the common control directions · 消去共同控制方向"
    },
    {
      "id": "e150000000000009",
      "fromNode": "0150000000000009",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "0150000000000008",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Residual slope recovers the partial coefficient · 残差斜率恢复偏系数"
    },
    {
      "id": "e15000000000000a",
      "fromNode": "0150000000000005",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "0150000000000006",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "A fitted identity does not test population exogeneity · 拟合恒等式不检验总体外生性"
    },
    {
      "id": "e15000000000000b",
      "fromNode": "0150000000000006",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "015000000000000a",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Unbiasedness needs a separate full-design condition · 无偏另需给定完整设计的条件"
    },
    {
      "id": "e15000000000000c",
      "fromNode": "015000000000000a",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "015000000000000b",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "无偏与一致性的条件不可互换"
    },
    {
